correction('P000552','Cauchy spectral smoothing',r'Unqualified convolution with \(\varepsilon/(\lambda^2+\varepsilon^2)\)',r'Specify cutoff or a convergent regularization; divide by \(\pi\) for a normalized Cauchy kernel','Weyl growth makes the positive frequency sum divergent in dimension at least2; for Laplacian energy eigenvalues it converges only below dimension4.','ambiguity')
correction('P000553','oscillatory trace versus heat trace',r'\(\sum e^{i\lambda_kz}=\operatorname{Tr}(e^{-z\Delta})\)',r'For \(\lambda_k=\sqrt{\mu_k}\), use \(\operatorname{Tr}(\exp(i z\sqrt L))\); heat trace uses \(\exp(-z\mu_k)\)','The scan confirms the two different exponents. The later half-wave equation supports the frequency interpretation.','faithful_error')
